44: Method `Nette\Forms\Container::setDefaults()` is replaced by `setDefaults(values: $values, ...)`.
45: Method `Nette\Forms\Container::setValues()` is replaced by `setValues(values: $values, ...)`.
52: Property `Nette\Forms\Controls\BaseControl::$caption` is replaced by `getCaption()`.
53: Property `Nette\Forms\Controls\BaseControl::$caption` is replaced by `setCaption($value)`.
54: Method `Nette\Forms\Controls\BaseControl::getOption()` is replaced by `getOption($key) ?? $default`.
