69: Property `Nette\Forms\Controls\ChoiceControl::$checkAllowedValues` is replaced by `checkDefaultValue($value)`.
70: Method `Nette\Forms\Controls\SelectBox::addOptionAttributes()` is deprecated: use `setOptionAttribute()`, which sets one attribute per call, so call it once for each item of the array, since nette/forms 3.2.
71: Method `Nette\Forms\Controls\MultiSelectBox::addOptionAttributes()` is deprecated: use `setOptionAttribute()`, which sets one attribute per call, so call it once for each item of the array, since nette/forms 3.2.
75: Method `Nette\Forms\Controls\TextInput::setType()` is replaced by `TextInput::setHtmlType()`.
