81: Class `Nette\Forms\Controls\CsrfProtection` is deprecated: there is no replacement; the built-in same-origin protection of the form is sufficient, since nette/forms 3.3.
81: Class `Nette\Forms\Rendering\DataClassGenerator` is removed: use `Nette\Forms\Blueprint`, whose `dataClass()` prints the generated class and exits and whose `generateDataClass()` returns it without the `$useSmartObject` option, since nette/forms 3.1.15.
83: Property `Nette\Forms\Form::$renderer` is replaced by `getRenderer()`.
84: Property `Nette\Forms\Form::$renderer` is replaced by `setRenderer($value)`.
85: Method `Nette\Forms\Container::getValues()` is replaced by `getValues('array')`.
86: Class `Nette\Forms\Rendering\LatteRenderer` is removed: use `Nette\Forms\Blueprint`, whose `latte()` prints the generated template and exits and whose `generateLatte()` returns it, since nette/forms 3.1.15.
87: Method `Nette\Forms\Rendering\LatteRenderer::render()` is replaced by `(new \Nette\Forms\Blueprint)->generateLatte($form)`.
88: Method `Nette\Forms\Rendering\DataClassGenerator::generateCode()` is replaced by `(new \Nette\Forms\Blueprint)->generateDataClass($form, $this->propertyPromotion, ...)`.
92: Class `Nette\Forms\FormFactory` is removed: create the form with `new Nette\Forms\Form`; the class and its DI service are gone, since nette/forms 3.1.5.
94: Class `Nette\Forms\Controls\CsrfProtection` is deprecated: there is no replacement; the built-in same-origin protection of the form is sufficient, since nette/forms 3.3.
94: Constant `Nette\Forms\Form::PROTECTION` is replaced by `Nette\Forms\Controls\CsrfProtection::PROTECTION`.
