108: Method `attached()` is a hook `nette/component-model` no longer calls; its logic belongs to a callback of `monitor()`.
116: Static method `Nette\Forms\Controls\BaseControl::enableAutoOptionalMode()` is removed: controls are optional automatically; drop the call, since nette/forms 3.0.
136: Method `Nette\Forms\Form::addProtection()` is deprecated: the built-in same-origin protection of the form is sufficient; drop the call, since nette/forms 3.3.
